*******************************************************************************
*                            KNOWN BUGS / PROBLEMS                            *
*******************************************************************************

- I have received 2 reports of cases where the program had trouble obtaining
  the file lock. I have not been able to reproduce it here, so more information
  on the specific doings of the user(s) is needed here. 

  When this is happening, it means the previous user has caused it, so ask him
  about his doings! ;-). There are 2 methods of removing the filelock manually:
  1) Remove the lock with ARTM,
  2) Reboot your BBS.

  I hope I have this squashed in v2.20, so it shouldn't happen anymore!

  NOTE: Make sure the Keyfile exists in the Typer directory!
 


